  "packageHash": "FuXkbDubMjOrnQAsRIAljKPdws5ijj0lqB1ZJeTPtwGj+kAQfWxwQSgnUoUwbg/JayS4QKVSBO22QYx+ad4MTg==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 90441,
  "published": "2026-11-10T18:41:36.02Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added:\n- C# 7 out-argument declarations and discards (Foo(..., out int x), out _)\n- Zero-initialized struct construction (new T()) and default / default(T) values\n- float.MaxValue / MinValue / Epsilon and int/uint limit constants in shader code\n- [loop] hints on emitted loops (keeps fxc compile time and code size down)\n- Semantic-model cache for translated helper classes (large shaders translate ~200x faster)\n- Disk bytecode cache for compiled shaders (opt out with DIVISION_DISABLE_SHADER_CACHE=1)\n- GetData(ctx, Span<T>) readback overloads for every buffer/texture wrapper\n- Explicit ShaderFlags overload on CompileHLSL\nFixed:\n- Hexadecimal integer literals ending in F (0xFF) were rewritten as 0x.0\n- Helper methods called with nested math.* arguments failed overload resolution\n- Roslyn compilation missed the framework facade references (System.Runtime)",
